    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1061">

                <pb facs="1153" n="1057" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1057"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Sir Julian Pauncefote
                        to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-17"><hi rendition="#italic">February 17,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that I am
                    commanded by the Queen to convey to the President the expression of Her
                    Majesty’s sympathy with the American people on the occasion of the sad disaster
                    which has befallen their Navy by the loss of the battle ship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Maine</hi> and of so many members of her crew. I request
                    that you will be good enough to transmit the above message to its high
                    destination.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Julian Pauncefote.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
